This week in Linear

Linear for Agents
Assign issues to coding agents the same way you assign them to people. Agents post progress in the issue, open a PR, and hand back for review. Works with the GitHub integration out of the box.

Cycle analytics
Scope change, completion rate, and carry-over for every cycle, with a trend line across the last eight. Team leads can see where the plan and the reality diverge.

Faster app
We rewrote the sync engine. Cold start is 2x faster and large workspaces feel it most.

Also shipped: issue templates per team, Slack notifications for project updates, and a dark theme refresh.

